'' An extern or common variable cannot be initialised; a UDT whose constructors include no
'' default one cannot be declared without an initialiser; and a declaration may not cross
'' the string/number divide, for a variable exactly as for a constant. A STATIC MEMBER is
'' really an extern, and a DYNAMIC ARRAY cannot be a union member.
''
'' THIS GOLDEN HAD FROZEN A DECLINE. 'dim shared constructed as NeedsArg = NeedsArg( 1 )'
'' on line 57 could not be folded to bytes, so it declined at lowerstore.bas and the
'' golden recorded that. It is constructed in the module initialiser now, the way fbc
'' does it, and the file is at 0 statements not lowered.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/extern-init-and-ctor.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' GOLDEN: expected/extern-init-and-ctor.out
